---
// Footer（參考 auwa）：深底、左標語、右社群、版權左下、IG icon 右下。
// 底色用品牌暖深棕（ink），非 auwa 冷藍。標語為暫定文案，待 PO 定案。
---

<footer class="bg-ink text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-frame px-6 py-16 md:px-9 md:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
      <!-- 左：標語 -->
      <div class="max-w-[520px]">
        <p class="text-xs tracking-[3px] text-white/40">女人我最大賞 2026</p>
        <p class="mt-5 font-serif text-2xl leading-relaxed md:text-3xl">
          <span class="text-white">美，由我綻放。</span>
          <span class="text-white/55">每年，我們以 UNFURL 六大趨勢，閱讀當代美的走向。</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 右：社群 -->
      <nav class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:items-end">
        <a
          href="#"
          class="text-base text-white/70 transition-colors hover:text-white"
          data-track="social_ig"
        >
          Instagram
        </a>
        <a
          href="#"
          class="text-base text-white/70 transition-colors hover:text-white"
          data-track="social_fb"
        >
          Facebook
        </a>
        <a
          href="#"
          class="text-base text-white/70 transition-colors hover:text-white"
          data-track="social_yt"
        >
          YouTube
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- 底列：版權左下、IG icon 右下 -->
    <div class="mt-16 flex items-center justify-between md:mt-24">
      <p class="text-xs text-white/40">© 2026 TVBS 聯利媒體股份有限公司 All Rights Reserved.</p>
      <a
        href="#"
        class="text-white/40 transition-colors hover:text-white"
        data-track="social_ig_icon"
        aria-label="Instagram"
      >
        <i class="ti ti-brand-instagram text-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
